Account Scheduled for Deletion

Your Firezone account "<%= @account.slug %>" (<%= @account.id %>) had no activity in the two weeks after our inactivity reminder. We disabled the account and scheduled it for permanent deletion.

Scheduled deletion date: <%= Calendar.strftime(@account.scheduled_deletion_at, "%B %-d, %Y") %>

Admins can still sign in. To keep this account, cancel the deletion in your account settings before the deadline:
<%= @settings_url %>

If you no longer need this account, no action is needed.

Thanks,
The Firezone Team
